  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十七关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "後撤！重整隊形！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "讓他們走吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "再這樣下去，我們的隊伍會被敵人分隔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果敵人還有後續的戰力增援，後果不堪設想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這些整合運動......不是在針對我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "優先保證我方幹員的安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "狙擊幹員，暫時停止對撤退的整合運動的攻擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "優先支援星熊警官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "真煩人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "不錯不錯，居然被你撐住了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "不過，你還能撐幾發呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那要看你的命有多硬了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "——————老陳！快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "包圍那個女人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "哦哦，近衛局的後援嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "放下你的武器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "陳長官，我們又見面了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "油腔滑調不能救你的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你對龍門做的，我會加倍在你身上討回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "哎呀~真可怕~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "但我這次不是來找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "阿米婭，接好~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我？這是......行動電話......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是的，有人想和你說點事~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "————————？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "好，這樣我的任務就完成啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "另外這個，不是給阿米婭的，而是送給你們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "後會有期囉~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——近距離爆破——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不對，是閃光彈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "別被她迷惑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——來不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "已經讓她跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "跑起來可也真的是快，趁著近衛局還沒穩定陣形，一瞬間就溜走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你也要小心你手上的東西，如果是炸彈的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......這個，倒是普通的行動電話沒錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只是......莫非......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎！告訴我你在哪！我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "少女的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......優先......處理重傷人員！！給他輸血！！快啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可惡......為什麼......明明都是感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島......這些傢伙為什麼會做這種事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我們從一開始就被他們遺棄了！！沒有出路的......沒有......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男孩的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別死！別死啊！我們說好，說好要一起回家的......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女孩的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗚......哥哥......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽到了嗎，這些聲音......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是整合運動的感染者......嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我一直忘不掉。我只是......不願想起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，是整合運動毀了我們的家，我爸爸也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但......這是我們，自作自受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年，我眼睜睜地看著我的弟弟被拖走......他哭著叫我的名字，我卻轉過頭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——躲進了自己的房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當他又來找我的時候......他放棄了許多東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他依然愛著我，我卻害怕了，逃跑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這一切只是要讓當時迫害他們的人，都嘗嘗感染者遭受的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今我是感染者了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也到了，我該償還自己罪孽的時候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎，別做傻事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論過去的人們怎麼對待感染者，只要你現在改變——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我又能，改變得了什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為我，就是當年視而不見的人之一......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "成為感染者之後，我看得......更加清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "普通人是怎麼對待感染者的，感染者也會那樣去對待普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是他們應得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這一切，不過是我自己種下的殘忍種子所結的惡果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我理應受到這樣的折磨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，為什麼，為什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他明明，什麼錯也沒有啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他只不過是突然被發現是感染者而已......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當時的他，才剛剛開始要我幫他寫作業啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我，如果那時候，保護了他的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎！冷靜點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "傷害無辜市民的並不是你！這些都不是你的錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在最開始，誰又不是無辜的呢？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "錯的，錯的就只有感染者這個身份而已......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果這只是互相報復的話，是誰，是誰導致了這悲劇呢......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果烏薩斯沒有把感染者當作可怕的牲畜一樣對待......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又有誰會恨烏薩斯入骨呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼感染者，就一定要遭遇這些折磨呢！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碎骨已經死了，你可以回到我們這裡，我們一定會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......阿米婭。我已經有了答案......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是一個感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我站在感染者這邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，阿米婭，你也是感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該能夠理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，我也是......羅德島大家和我，都知道你的想法......我明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，米莎，僅僅是將自己從普通人置換到感染者的身份中，是什麼都不會改變的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請等等我，我立刻來找你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——米莎！你在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說得對，阿米婭，你說得對......我只是愧疚而已。我只是......太過軟弱了而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我已經決定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使只有一步，我也要......踏出這一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起，阿米婭，對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "整合運動是感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們，也是感染者啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再見了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎？米莎？！米莎！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
